WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:27.174
Eddy and his friends raced.

2
00:00:27.175 --> 00:00:47.510
They drove around the racetrack.

3
00:00:47.511 --> 00:00:51.084
"Eddy won!" cried Poppy.

4
00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:54.967
"Let's race again!" said Eddy.

5
00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:58.161
"Yeah!" said Dipper.

6
00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:01.655
"Racing is fun!"

7
00:01:01.656 --> 00:01:05.932
"You're too fast, Eddy," said Jeb.

8
00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:09.018
"You win all the time."

9
00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:15.057
"Let's play tag," said Dipper.

10
00:01:15.058 --> 00:01:24.741
"I love tag," said Poppy.

11
00:01:24.742 --> 00:01:27.487
She tagged Eddy.

12
00:01:27.488 --> 00:01:30.456
"You're it!" said Poppy.

13
00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:32.472
She took off.

14
00:01:32.473 --> 00:01:41.563
Eddy started to follow.

15
00:01:41.564 --> 00:01:45.096
"I don't like tag," said Jeb.

16
00:01:45.097 --> 00:01:53.442
"I'm too slow for it."

17
00:01:53.443 --> 00:01:56.553
Poppy and Eddy came back.

18
00:01:56.554 --> 00:01:59.872
"Hmm," said Poppy.

19
00:01:59.873 --> 00:02:02.904
"Let's tell funny jokes.

20
00:02:02.905 --> 00:02:06.308
Tell a funny joke, Jeb!"

21
00:02:06.309 --> 00:02:09.867
"Um," said Jeb.

22
00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:13.613
"I don't know any funny jokes."

23
00:02:13.614 --> 00:02:16.825
Jeb sighed.

24
00:02:16.826 --> 00:02:23.059
"I'm not really good at anything."
